  "title": "MUI virtual node-list tester firmware (T-Deck)",
  "releaseNotes": "## Virtual MUI node-list tester firmware\n\nTester-only Meshtastic firmware for validating the MUI virtual node-list implementation. This is not a Meshtastic stable release.\n\nBefore and after flashing, please test: add/receive 250 nodes; scroll rapidly; update an off-screen node; filter, reorder, and resync; look for stale rows, crashes, or memory problems; then report device target and result.\n\nSource is pinned to RCGV1/firmware-Fork@599f1c36ec5738cae8d330b095ff9f3f868b1ea3 with RCGV1/device-ui@9e84d74cb9bc4f2ef4cc577912b3d11b2ad29504 and DEVICE_UI_MUI_VIRTUAL_NODE_LIST enabled.",
